      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A stunning new A-rated semi-detached 4 bedroom home in the highly regarded Barley Hill Court development, located in the heart of Bohola village, Co. Mayo. Currently under construction, the property extends to approximately 1,259 sq. ft. and offers bright, spacious accommodation designed for modern family living. Built to the highest standards, the home benefits from an A-rated energy certificate, featuring excellent insulation, airtight construction, and an efficient air-to-water heat pump system to ensure year-round comfort and low running costs. Inside, the property comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a generous kitchen, living and dining area with direct access to the rear garden, bedroom (ensuite) and WC. Upstairs there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, along with a main family bathroom. Outside, the home includes a private driveway and landscaped surroundings within a small, well-maintained development. Barley Hill Court enjoys an excellent location within easy walking distance of Bohola village centre, where you'll find everyday amenities such as a local shop, post office, pubs, church, and community centre. The area offers a friendly, community-oriented lifestyle, ideal for families or anyone seeking a quieter pace of life without sacrificing convenience. The property is superbly connected, just off the N5, providing quick access to nearby towns and services. Castlebar is approximately 20 km away, Ballina about 27 km, Claremorris 22 km, and Ireland West Airport Knock is just a 20-minute drive, offering excellent travel links nationwide and beyond. Bus services operate locally, and the surrounding countryside provides a wealth of outdoor activities, sports facilities, and scenic walking routes. This new A-rated home at Barley Hill Court presents a rare opportunity to enjoy the benefits of a modern, energy-efficient home in a peaceful rural setting, close to major Mayo towns and amenities. Perfect for first-time buyers, families, or those seeking a comfortable new home in a welcoming community, this property blends contemporary design, quality construction, and an enviable location in the heart of County Mayo.\r\n\r\nQualifies for the Help to Buy Scheme."
      },
